  author    = "Lacour, C and Massart, P",
  abstract  = "This paper is concerned with adaptive nonparametric estimation
               using the Goldenshluger--Lepski selection method. This estimator
               selection method is based on pairwise comparisons between
               estimators with respect to some loss function. The method also
               involves a penalty term that typically needs to be large enough
               in order that the method works (in the sense that one can prove
